de good starts, while Villoresi was slow away, leaving a gap for Gonz\u00e1lez to quickly move into the lead with his much lighter car.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":1,"text":"At the end of the first lap Gonz\u00e1lez had built a 2.8 second gap over the other Italian cars, the order being Ascari, Villoresi, Bonetto, Fangio, Hawthorn, Farina and Marim\u00f3n, with the gap from second to eighth just 2.2 seconds.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":2,"text":"They were followed by the Maseratis of Fangio and Marim\u00f3n, with Bonetto dropping to ninth after a spin, behind Trintignant, Bira and de Graffenried.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":15},{"lap":23,"text":"On lap 23, Fangio overtook Farina, who responded by setting the then fastest lap of the race and retaking the position.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":1},{"lap":30,"text":"Gonz\u00e1lez's pitstop took just 27 seconds, but this allowed Fangio into the lead, with Gonz\u00e1lez dropping all the way down to sixth, ahead of Villoresi but behind Marim\u00f3n who had just passed him.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":30,"text":"At half distance, Fangio lead Hawthorn and Ascari, the top three separated by less than a second, followed at small intervals by Farina, Marim\u00f3n, then Gonz\u00e1lez and Villoresi just a second apart, around 20 seconds behind Fangio.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":1},{"lap":32,"text":"Over the next few laps, Fangio and Hawthorn would swap the lead several times, sometimes more than once a lap, pulling slowly away from Ascari who was locked in a close battle with Farina, Gonz\u00e1lez and Marim\u00f3n.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":38,"text":"Gonz\u00e1lez continued to push, catching and overtaking Farina then Ascari on lap 37.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":60,"text":"With two laps to go, Fangio and Hawthorn crossed the finish line side by side, followed less than a second later by Gonz\u00e1lez and Ascari, also side by side.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":1},{"lap":60,"text":"Coming into the final straight Gonz\u00e1lez was able to overlap slightly on Fangio, but Hawthorn lead the pair, winning the race by just one second from Fangio, with Gonz\u00e1lez just 0.4 seconds behind in third place.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}],"x":{"drivers":[{"id":704,"ref":"cabantous","name":"Yves Cabantous","code":null,"nationality":"French","dob":"1904-10-08","helmet":null,"seasons":{"1953":{"car":"hwm_1953","source":"history","skills":{"pace":[0.3862,0.5],"quali":[0.3862,0.5]}}}}],"cars":[]}}